def copy : (Ran SPi 1 n (Lan SMu Chain [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (Lan SMu Chain [] (Sec SColl 0 []))) := (Sec SPi 1 n (Lan SMu Chain [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) [n => (Elim SMu Chain [] n as self return (Lan SMu Chain [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) with | (ACtor stop)  => (In SMu Chain [] (ACtor stop) []) | (ACtor step) tail => (In SMu Chain [] (ACtor step) [(Out SPi 1 n (Lan SMu Chain [] (Sec SColl 0 [])) (APt 1 tail) copy)]))])
